    {
      "text": "It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can control its body temperature at will. This enables it to freeze the moisture in the atmosphere, creating flurries of diamond dust.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It freezes its fur into icicles, spiky and sharp, and tackles its prey.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It protects itself by freezing its fur into sharp needles. It can drop its body temperature below –75 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can instantaneously freeze any moisture that’s around it, creating ice pellets to shoot at its prey.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Any who become captivated by the beauty of the snowfall that Glaceon creates will be frozen before they know it.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coldness emanating from Glaceon causes powdery snow to form, making it quite a popular Pokémon at ski resorts.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Glaceon is able to lower its body temperature very quickly. It freezes the atmosphere, creating diamond dust that glitters like gems while it flutters and dances around.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
